  "caption": "Capri is small, but where you sleep changes the whole trip.\n\nWant to be in the middle of it? Capri town, around the Piazzetta. Calmer evenings? Anacapri. Easy arrival by ferry? Marina Grande. Swimming first? Marina Piccola. Quiet nights and views of the Faraglioni? Tragara.\n\nSend this to the person you'd go with.\n\n#capri #italy #italytravel",
